Package: millerx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: poppler-utils, pkexec, ffmpeg
Description: small native file browser with Miller columns
 millerX shows folders as columns from / to the current folder, with a
 preview on the right: pictures, PDF pages, text, archive contents and
 folder sizes. Open with, terminal here, Thunar-compatible copy and paste,
 drag and drop, bookmarks shared with Thunar, USB drives, properties,
 resizable columns and "Open as root" through polkit.
